# Local example only: start the separate test backend described in ../README.md first.
# Copy to web/.env.local; keep existing local settings if the file already exists.
# Full reachable HTTP(S) API base URL, including its actual port; no /auth/register suffix.
# localhost works only on this computer. On a phone use the server LAN address.
# An HTTPS published frontend needs a reachable HTTPS API and its exact origin in CORS_ORIGINS.
# Restart Vite after changes; production values must be set before build and redeploy.
# VITE_* is public browser configuration. Never put passwords or tokens here.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
